 / can’t","**I can cook. I can’t swim.**"],["Imperativos","**Wash. Don’t touch. Be careful.**"],["Verbos-chave","**have, go, come**"],["S + V + O","**She cooks pasta.**"]],"cap":"Resumo da Unidade 3"},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Erros que ainda aparecem","body":"**There is three eggs**, **can to**, **go to home**"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice · Mixed review","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences (from the unit)","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"Let’s ___ lunch.","a":"have","why":"have lunch.","say":"Let’s have lunch"},{"s":"___ a table in the kitchen.","a":"There is","why":"singular.","say":"There is a table"},{"s":"I ___ it is good. (think/this)","a":"think","why":"think = achar."},{"s":"___ a park near? — Yes, ___ .","a":["Is there","there is"],"why":"singular."},{"s":"___ three eggs.","a":"There are","why":"plural."},{"s":"My mother ___ soup. (make)","a":"makes","why":"mother → makes."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["lunch","almoço"],["dinner","jantar"],["sandwich","sanduíche"],["light","leve"],["meeting","reunião"],["tall","alto"]]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Unit word bank","blocks":[{"type":"words","items":[["lunch","almoço"],["dinner","jantar"],["sandwich","sanduíche"],["light","leve"],["meeting","reunião"],["tall","alto"],["short","baixo, curto"],["fun","diversão"],["oven","forno"],["dishwasher","lava-louças"],["fat","gordo"],["thin","magro"],["fridge","geladeira"],["stove","fogão"],["middle","meio"],["strong","forte"],["weak","fraco"],["thank","agradecer"],["young","jovem"],["this","este, esta"],["that","aquele"],["they","eles"],["tongue","língua"],["teeth","dentes"],["rent","aluguel"],["apartment","apartamento"],["elevator","elevador"],["dirty","sujo"],["balcony","varanda"],["full","cheio"],["block","quarteirão"],["bright","claro, iluminado"],["closed","fechado"],["cheese","queijo"],["difficult","difícil"],["quick","rápido"],["slow","lento"],["careful","cuidadoso"],["loud","alto (som)"],[